    See LICENSE-docs.

GitHub displays only one licence per repository, and it reads this file. "MIT"
in the sidebar is therefore correct about the code and silent about the prose,
which is why the split is stated here, at the top, rather than left to be
discovered.

The essays, quotes and other content published on itonlyhappensonce.blog are not
stored in this repository; they are held in a database and are not licensed by
either file. All rights to them are reserved.

